body:
Hi {{first_name}},

Thanks again for having us out. Your estimate for the {{project}} came to {{bid_amount}}.

If anything in it needs a second look, or you'd like me to walk you through it, just reply here or call me at {{owner_phone}}.

{{owner_name}}
{{business_name}}

Hi {{first_name}},

Wanted to check in on the {{project}} estimate. If anything needs adjusting, whether that's scope, timing, or budget, tell me and I'll rework it.

If you're ready to go, reply here and we'll get you on the schedule.

{{owner_name}}
{{business_name}}

Hi {{first_name}},

It's been a week since I sent over the {{project}} estimate, so I wanted to reach out one more time. Totally understand if you're comparing bids or the timing isn't right.

If it helps, I'm glad to answer anything about materials, timeline, or the price. Just reply and let me know where things stand.

{{owner_name}}
{{business_name}}
